    "title": "だからふたりは",
    "enTitle": "So, The Two Are —",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "密着取材？",
            "enText": "A close-coverage TV program?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 51,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ、俺たちの普段の様子を撮りたいって",
                    "enText": "Yeah, seems like they want to capture our day to day life",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん、私たちの普段の様子を撮りたいって",
                    "enText": "Yeah, seems like they want to capture our day to day life",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 124,
                    "pathId": -2205260154085025184
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": -5687955128103461906
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 62,
                    "pathId": 1932881528360975002
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8675053918971171716,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "時代の中心となったウマ娘とそのトレーナー。\n知られざる日々に迫る、という題目の\nテレビ番組企画のようだが――",
            "enText": "It seems that the plan for this segment was \nto go behind-the-scenes on a horsegirl and \nher trainer who have become the centre of \nattention of this generation, though —",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": 3541799186740431376
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": 5563029207344871777
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 126,
                    "pathId": 5048007164451795971
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7482710993602736753,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "へぇ～、物好きもいるもんだなぁ。\n……ま、いいんじゃないか？　やっても。",
            "enText": "Hm～ There's some interesting people out \nthere huh… Well, sounds alright to me, if \nwe do it?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 91,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "じゃあ先方にはOKで返事しておくよ",
                    "enText": "Then I'll give them the OK",
                    "nextBlock": 4
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 166,
                    "pathId": 1255325603829325565
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 26,
                    "pathId": -7550797500008627579
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 6330549226196173899
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5924255245918613659,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "あいよ。",
            "enText": "Gotcha.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 80,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6004065344553778746
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": -652172787678538931
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 110,
                    "pathId": -4586787265604863224
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4851401501599673454,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "そして、取材当日。\n撮影スタッフが学園にやってきたのだが――",
            "enText": "Then, it became the filming day. The crew \nhave all arrived on site at the academy \nbut —",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（ステゴが……いない！！）",
                    "enText": "(Stego's… Not here!!)",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -401498609655484638
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 5652918858761032936
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1579838980043710241,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "あの～、日を改めたほうがいいですか……？",
            "enText": "Hi there～ Would it be better \nif we changed the date…?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 71,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いえ！大丈夫です！",
                    "enText": "Oh! Today should be all fine!",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8549714687651099129,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "正直こうなることは半分予想していた。\nなので――",
            "enText": "To be honest, I half expected this to happen. \nWhich is why ——",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 76,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "今からステゴのところに行きます",
                    "enText": "We're heading to Stego's location now",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3587593657755974098,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "あ、よかった……！　トレーナーさんは、\nステイゴールドさんの居場所を\nご存じだったんですね！",
            "enText": "Ah, what a relief…! You can leave it to \nTrainer to know exactly where Stay Gold \nis right now!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 105,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いえ、わからないです",
                    "enText": "No, I'm actually not sure myself",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2041566956242951574,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "えっ……？",
            "enText": "Eh……?",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 51,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "でも多分大丈夫です！",
                    "enText": "But it should be completely fine!",
                    "nextBlock": 10
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4826946006689086361,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "えええ……？？",
            "enText": "Ehhhh……??",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 54,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 837551864693684662,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "――――",
            "enText": "————",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 50,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ステゴーっ！！",
                    "enText": "Stegooo!!",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 124,
                    "pathId": -4522874859504121037
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 8223153464774512643
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6223067601475877023,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "う、嘘だろ……本当にいた……\n学園から車で小一時間だぞ……？",
            "enText": "N-No way… She really was here… \nIt took an entire hour to drive \nhere from the academy…?",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 84,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 68,
                    "pathId": -4089541327227340172
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 95,
                    "pathId": -8437507945833330835
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1333729230685921859,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "おう、トレーナーか。\n……って――",
            "enText": "Yo, it's Trainer… Oh —",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 67,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 446870371740331509
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 2914909313356626449
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5746228135169673606,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "あ～。今日、取材の日だっけか。\nわるいわるい、忘れてた。",
            "enText": "Ah～ Filming was today huh. My bad, \nmy bad, I forgot about this.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 81,
            "voiceIdx": 24,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": -5854652919482573895
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 92,
                    "pathId": -2516042943446840648
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8128062967815153269,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "それにしても驚きました。\n実は、事前に行く場所とか\n共有されていたんですか？",
            "enText": "Even so, what a surprise. Did you perhaps \nlet your trainer know beforehand where \nyou were going to be?",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 459585080497586769
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 134,
                    "pathId": 6622710311559789893
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7150458754488530282,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "いや、全然。\nいつもこんな感じだよ。",
            "enText": "Nah, not at all. We normally \njust vibe it out like this.",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 68,
            "voiceIdx": 50,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "いつも捜してます",
                    "enText": "I'm always searching for her",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 37,
                    "pathId": -6750142300388436309
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": 1852123652741359003
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8286284075513744288,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "そ、そうなんですね……。",
            "enText": "I-I see……",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 60,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 71,
                    "pathId": 94850690503541077
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 71,
                    "pathId": -3058983543081627477
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7269802876221232677,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "密着取材だったよな。\nじゃあ、これから早速――",
            "enText": "This is going to be a \"close coverage\" kind \nof episode right. Then, right now it's —",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 75,
            "voiceIdx": 80,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 48,
                    "pathId": 5594935950938266119
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": 8580686227568430952
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1400685600115997766,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "は！\nもしや学外で秘密のトレーニングを……！？",
            "enText": "Woah! Is this going to be some sort of \nsecret off campus training session…!?",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 75,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": 6600972352562650400
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 86,
                    "pathId": -3340013866022852567
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7719603496620846993,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "飯だな。",
            "enText": "Time for food.",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 50,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "蕎麦とかどう？さっきよさそうな店あったよ",
                    "enText": "Soba OK? I saw a nice store on the way",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 4,
                    "pathId": -3868618871421735902
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 61,
                    "pathId": 3820799059164055750
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5513213822409060506,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "お、いいね。行こう行こう。",
            "enText": "Oh, sounds good. Let's go, let's go.",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": 97,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": 6386491307364303917
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 19,
                    "pathId": -2464463670074626380
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 72,
                    "pathId": -564861241205379546
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -314729881961669266,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "撮影ディレクター",
            "enName": "Director",
            "jpText": "こ、これが時代の中心を走るコンビ……――",
            "enText": "S-So it's these two who make up the \nracing combo of this generation……",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 71,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": -566640969509743065
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 127,
                    "pathId": -3750902295095527501
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": 4628005209264476345
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -386821944401529531,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テレビの音声",
            "enName": "TV Voiceover",
            "jpText": "『その後もふたりは、息の合った様子で\nその場その場の状況を楽しんでいた』",
            "enText": "\"After that, the two continued to sway from \nplace to place with perfect coordination, \nenjoying their day\"",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 91,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 7776020862592015745
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 3144390967603318696
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -8509120577163649505
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": 2510801769507121957
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 177,
                    "pathId": -5403244728992670819
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1686735287539008914,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テレビの音声",
            "enName": "TV Voiceover",
            "jpText": "『気の置けない仲、とは正に\nふたりのことを言うのだろう。\n我々は偉業の裏側にある絆を垣間見た――』",
            "enText": "\"You can only describe the two as the \nclosest of friends, and we were able to \nwitness just how strong the bond which \nholds up all their achievements actually is —\"",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（結局ただ散歩してる様子で終わった……）",
                    "enText": "(We ended up just strolling around…)",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 119,
                    "pathId": 2219212861388035207
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 119,
                    "pathId": 6509206565587841477
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6246687825533553836,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "ハハッ、なんだかいい感じに\nまとめてもらったが――\nま、この方がらしいだろ。",
            "enText": "Haha, feels as though they collected a \nfew good scenes for us, though… \nWell, this is typical for us right.",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 147,
                    "pathId": 5842942018790829335
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 55,
                    "pathId": -3315861863263473325
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 105,
                    "pathId": 5941866499190916959
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2782741184624398808,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ステイゴールド",
            "enName": "Stay Gold",
            "jpText": "それに、嘘は何も言ってないわけだしな。",
            "enText": "It's not like there were any lies either.",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 69,
            "voiceIdx": 37,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "まぁ……そうだね",
                    "enText": "Well… That's true",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -6523653894360435710
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": -8859637001824664171
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 8783043756513562219
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4135187554958183032,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……放送後、この映像がファンの間で\n話題になり続編を希望されることは、\nこの時知る由もなかったのだった――",
            "enText": "…It was unexpected at the time, but this \nepisode became such a hot topic amongst \nfans, to the point where many wished to \nsee a second episode —",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": -616140391143101291
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 125,
                    "pathId": -6718892792096486689
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -594533129636460605,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サイレンススズカ",
            "enName": "Silence Suzuka",
            "jpText": "『――えっと……私の知る限り、\nおふたりはいつもそんな感じだと思います。\nその時その時を、全力で楽しむというか――』",
            "enText": "\"—Uhm…… To the best of my knowledge, \nthose two always seemed that way to \nmyself. If it's one day or another, they'll \nenjoy it to the fullest and such —\"",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": 79,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -3043797813376062349
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 7830406326997375438
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": 2193844747683288813
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": 8741343183670934977
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": 3018543456042792742
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 172,
                    "pathId": 7662028798532481070
