        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "『ええ、私たちもよ～く知っていますよ！\nおふたりが、強い縁で繋がっていることを！』",
            "enText": "\"Yeah, we know them <i>ve～ry</i> well! Also \nabout that fated bond of theirs which \nis absolutely unbreakable!\"",
